{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimit","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.MarkovTraceInstance","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.OcneanuTrace","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.HeckeSandwichReduces"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.disjointBlock_heckeColimit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.disjointBlock_heckeColimit","kind":"theorem","line":216,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.lean#L216-L219","doc":"**The disjoint-block trace law holds on the Iwahori–Hecke tower.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.towerSpan_heckeColimit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.towerSpan_heckeColimit","kind":"theorem","line":207,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.lean#L207-L214","doc":"**`TowerSpan` holds on the Iwahori–Hecke tower.**\n\n`H_{n+1} = H_n + H_n · g_n · H_n`, for the genuine Hecke algebras — not for the\nfree `HeckeTower` carrier.  Proved from the braid relations in #7153; this is its\ninstantiation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.braidedTower_heckeColimit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.braidedTower_heckeColimit","kind":"instance","line":194,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.lean#L194-L205","doc":"The colimit Markov trace is a **braided tower**.\n\n`quad` reads `g² = (q - q⁻¹)·g + (q·q⁻¹)·1` with `q·q⁻¹ = 1` discharged by\n`hq0`, giving `h = q - q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.heckeColimitMarkovTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.heckeColimitMarkovTrace","kind":"def","line":162,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.lean#L162-L186","doc":"**The bridge.**  The colimit of the Iwahori–Hecke tower, with the lifted\nOcneanu trace, is a `MathlibExt.OcneanuTrace.MarkovTrace`.\n\nEvery hypothesis is one `MarkovTraceInstance.wtrace` already carries; none is\nadded.  With this, the level-indexed `HeckeCoset.MarkovTraceFamily` and the\nsingle-algebra `OcneanuTrace.MarkovTrace` interfaces are connected, and the\ntower results proved against the latter — `tr_conj`, `tr_eq_of_isConj`,\n`tr_mul_stabWord`, and via step 3's braid relations `TowerSpan` and\n`DisjointBlockTraceLaw` — apply to the genuine Hecke tower. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.trLim_markov_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.trLim_markov_inv","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.lean#L148-L160","doc":"**(T3')** Markov stabilisation by the inverse generator.\n\nThe parameter `zinv = q³/(q²+1) - (q - q⁻¹)` is **derived** from\n`σ⁻¹ = σ - (q - q⁻¹)·1`, not posited. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.trLim_markov","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.trLim_markov","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.lean#L129-L146","doc":"**(T3)** Markov stabilisation on the colimit, with `z = q³/(q²+1)`\n(convention D). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.trLim_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.trLim_one","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.lean#L123-L127","doc":"**(T2)** Normalisation on the colimit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.trLim_cyclic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.trLim_cyclic","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.lean#L113-L121","doc":"**(T1)** The trace property on the colimit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.trLim_ofLim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.trLim_ofLim","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.lean#L109-L111","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.trLim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.trLim","kind":"def","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.lean#L100-L107","doc":"**The Ocneanu trace on the colimit.**\n\nA `Module` lift, not a `Ring` lift: `wtrace` is `ℝ`-linear but not\nmultiplicative, so `DirectLimit.Ring.lift` does not apply — and linearity is\nexactly what the `MarkovTrace.tr` field asks for. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.wtrace_inclLE","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.wtrace_inclLE","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitMarkovTrace.lean#L88-L98","doc":"The level-wise trace is compatible with the **iterated** inclusion.\n\n`wtrace_incl` gives one step; `DirectLimit.Module.lift` needs every step, and\nthis is the `Nat.le_induction` iterate. ","signatureChunk":0}]}